Whenever I get nervous, I get diarrhea.

22
00:02:10,759 --> 00:02:12,159
Almost done, almost done!

23
00:02:12,439 --> 00:02:13,240
Stop making excuses!

24
00:02:13,240 --> 00:02:14,759
