31
00:02:27,560 --> 00:02:28,840
Hurry up!

32
00:02:32,639 --> 00:02:33,719
Hurry up!

33
00:02:40,560 --> 00:02:41,479
Such a pain.

34
00:02:41,479 --> 00:02:43,599
What a terrible case of the runs.

35
00:02:45,199 --> 00:02:46,599
It stinks!

36
00:02:46,879 --> 00:02:48,879
You really need to clean the bathroom.

37
00:02:51,520 --> 00:02:53,800
Sir, rest assured.

38
00:02:53,800 --> 00:02:55,000
Reassured, my ass!

39
00:02:55,280 --> 00:02:58,159
You guys wasted such good material.

40
00:02:58,159 --> 00:03:00,800
The police are watching us too closely.

41
