Rest assured, it's much better now.

42
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:06,319
Don't let me down.

43
00:03:06,319 --> 00:03:07,560
Yes.

44
00:03:11,360 --> 00:03:12,159
Damn it.

45
00:03:13,159 --> 00:03:14,800
Working my ass off all day,

46
00:03:17,080 --> 00:03:19,000
and not a single word of praise.

47
00:03:20,599 --> 00:03:23,039
Who is this Sir?

48
00:03:24,039 --> 00:03:24,719
Xiao Lin.

49
00:03:25,199 --> 00:03:26,400
Have we found the fraud ring's hideout?

50
00:03:26,479 --> 00:03:27,159
Not yet.

51
00:03:27,400 --> 00:03:29,120
They must have signal jamming equipment.

52
00:03:29,120 --> 00:03:30,919
The messages we receive are intermittent.

53
00:03:30,919 --> 00:03:32,599
We can only track it to a general area.

54
00:03:34,960 --> 00:03:36,240
Keep searching based on this location.

55
00:03:55,840 --> 00:03:56,479
Sir.

56
00:03:57,120 --> 00:03:57,919
The police are on the move.

57
00:03:58,919 --> 00:03:59,639
Something's wrong.

58
00:04:08,599 --> 00:04:09,599
Boys,

59
00:04:09,840 --> 00:04:11,439
I just closed a deal.

60
00:04:11,439 --> 00:04:12,919
Everyone, keep pushing!

61
00:04:12,919 --> 00:04:14,639
Let's nail these college students.

62
00:04:14,759 --> 00:04:15,879
Are you with me?

63
00:04:17,959 --> 00:04:18,639
What's going on?

64
00:04:18,639 --> 00:04:20,439
Why did the computers crash?

65
00:04:20,800 --> 00:04:22,879
Bro Snake, they crashed!

66
00:04:25,399 --> 00:04:26,399
Who did this?

67
00:04:27,160 --> 00:04:28,560
Who's messing around?

68
00:04:28,800 --> 00:04:30,279
Get the hell out here!

69
00:04:34,079 --> 00:04:36,279
Sir, we have a minor situation.

70
00:04:36,279 --> 00:04:37,040
I'm handling it.

71
00:04:37,040 --> 00:04:37,839
The police are here!

72
00:04:37,839 --> 00:04:38,480
Quick, fall back!

73
00:04:39,240 --> 00:04:40,399
The police will be here any second!

74
00:04:40,480 --> 00:04:41,560
Destroy all evidence immediately!

75
00:04:41,560 --> 00:04:42,360
Hurry!

76
00:04:43,439 --> 00:04:45,720
Quickly destroy all hard drive data!

77
00:04:45,720 --> 00:04:46,279
Hurry!

78
00:04:49,399 --> 00:04:50,639
Fall back! Let's go!

79
00:05:22,040 --> 00:05:23,079
Split up!

80
00:05:23,079 --> 00:05:24,079
Don't follow me!

81
00:05:25,040 --> 00:05:25,680
Go!

82
00:05:28,600 --> 00:05:29,399
Old Gu!

83
00:05:29,839 --> 00:05:31,240
Run, Old Gu! Hurry!

84
00:05:31,759 --> 00:05:32,600
This way!

85
00:05:33,480 --> 00:05:34,480
I know this way!

86
00:05:34,600 --> 00:05:35,600
Hurry, hurry! Let's go!

87
00:06:01,120 --> 00:06:02,040
Hurry up.

88
00:06:30,279 --> 00:06:34,120
Head! Head! Head!

89
00:06:45,279 --> 00:06:46,800
Nobody move!

90
00:06:46,800 --> 00:06:47,600
Hands on your head!

91
00:06:47,600 --> 00:06:48,839
Don't move! Get down!

92
00:06:50,040 --> 00:06:50,839
Hands up! Don't move!

93
00:07:04,639 --> 00:07:05,439
Hands on your head, squat down!

94
00:07:16,839 --> 00:07:18,639
Everyone, gather in the courtyard.

95
00:07:29,040 --> 00:07:31,600
Hair...

96
00:07:33,360 --> 00:07:35,199
My hair...

97
00:07:39,199 --> 00:07:40,399
Don't!

98
00:07:52,480 --> 00:07:53,040
I'm fine.

99
00:07:56,360 --> 00:07:56,920
Get up.

100
00:08:00,439 --> 00:08:01,079
Bring them out.

101
00:08:06,079 --> 00:08:07,759
Everyone, form a circle and squat down.

102
00:08:12,720 --> 00:08:13,519
Captain.

103
00:08:14,279 --> 00:08:15,680
Grass Snake and Bro Liu are both missing.

104
00:08:15,800 --> 00:08:17,560
It's like they were tipped off.

105
00:08:17,879 --> 00:08:18,800
They couldn't have gone far.

106
00:08:19,399 --> 00:08:21,000
Cover all possible escape routes

107
00:08:21,079 --> 00:08:21,879
and deploy your men.

108
00:08:21,879 --> 00:08:22,360
Split up and pursue.

109
00:08:22,360 --> 00:08:22,879
Yes, sir.

110
00:08:23,040 --> 00:08:24,000
You three, come with me.

111
00:08:27,399 --> 00:08:28,879
Take everyone back to the station.

112
00:08:36,600 --> 00:08:38,759
Captain, why are there so few people?

113
00:08:38,759 --> 00:08:40,000
They have multiple hideouts.

114
00:08:40,679 --> 00:08:41,799
This is just one of them.

115
00:08:42,200 --> 00:08:43,279
So,

116
00:08:43,799 --> 00:08:45,440
our task ahead

117
00:08:45,440 --> 00:08:46,440
remains very challenging.

118
00:09:07,360 --> 00:09:08,200
You little rascal.

119
00:09:09,559 --> 00:09:10,960
I knew you'd hold something back.

120
00:09:27,519 --> 00:09:28,360
Let's take a break.

121
00:09:32,720 --> 00:09:34,519
To save you this time,

122
00:09:34,919 --> 00:09:37,240
I really took a huge risk.

123
00:09:37,960 --> 00:09:39,559
I almost lost my life.

124
00:09:41,879 --> 00:09:43,000
I really owe you this time.

125
00:09:43,759 --> 00:09:45,120
I thought you weren't going to help me.

126
00:09:47,720 --> 00:09:48,919
What exactly is your goal?

127
00:09:50,320 --> 00:09:51,360
I can't tell you right now.

128
00:09:53,879 --> 00:09:55,600
I've helped you so much,

129
00:09:56,000 --> 00:09:57,960
yet you still won't tell me the truth.

130
00:10:01,480 --> 00:10:04,279
Are you going to use me

131
00:10:04,559 --> 00:10:06,720
and let the police arrest me?

132
00:10:07,399 --> 00:10:08,720
There's no bad blood between us.

133
00:10:08,720 --> 00:10:09,799
I won't hurt you.

134
00:10:11,360 --> 00:10:12,159
I get it.

135
00:10:13,519 --> 00:10:14,879
In other words,

136
00:10:16,039 --> 00:10:18,080
you have a grudge against someone inside.

137
00:10:21,159 --> 00:10:23,200
It's better you don't know for now.

138
00:10:25,200 --> 00:10:26,360
Even though you're a scammer,

139
00:10:27,799 --> 00:10:28,919
you still have a conscience.

140
00:10:29,080 --> 00:10:30,240
As for extreme cases,

141
00:10:30,600 --> 00:10:31,879
you never get involved.

142
00:10:33,679 --> 00:10:35,279
But this isn't a long-term plan.

143
00:10:36,159 --> 00:10:37,720
For Gu Ting's sake,

144
00:10:41,559 --> 00:10:43,360
I advise you to stop.

145
00:10:46,320 --> 00:10:47,720
I'm getting old.

146
00:10:47,720 --> 00:10:48,960
I can't do anything else.

147
00:10:50,559 --> 00:10:51,759
I can't just starve to death.

148
00:10:55,519 --> 00:10:57,480
What if Huang Shanshan were your daughter?

149
00:11:01,919 --> 00:11:03,320
What if Gu Ting were the one scammed?

150
00:11:03,320 --> 00:11:04,399
What if Gu Ting were the one who died?

151
00:11:06,159 --> 00:11:07,600
Could you still be this calm?

152
00:11:14,879 --> 00:11:15,879
Xiao Lin.

153
00:11:15,879 --> 00:11:17,279
How's the analysis of the USB drive data?

154
00:11:18,879 --> 00:11:19,720
Captain.

155
00:11:20,320 --> 00:11:21,240
Look here.

156
00:11:22,919 --> 00:11:25,000
Your informant left a Chain Program.

157
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:26,159
The informant can only unilaterally

158
00:11:26,159 --> 00:11:27,399
send us some basic messages.

159
00:11:27,559 --> 00:11:29,720
But once the informant uses this channel,

160
00:11:29,919 --> 00:11:31,080
it will be extremely dangerous.

161
00:11:31,559 --> 00:11:33,080
Let's hope he won't need to use it.

162
00:11:34,759 --> 00:11:35,799
Did we find anything else?

163
00:11:36,240 --> 00:11:36,879
Come take a look.

164
00:11:38,000 --> 00:11:38,960
Everyone, come here for a sec.

165
00:11:42,120 --> 00:11:43,879
This fraud syndicate is very cunning.

166
00:11:43,879 --> 00:11:46,279
They chose hideouts close to the border.

167
00:11:46,600 --> 00:11:48,759
And these hideouts have a clear feature.

168
00:11:48,759 --> 00:11:50,759
They are century-old Enclosed Buildings.

169
00:11:50,759 --> 00:11:51,399
According to our investigation,

170
00:11:51,399 --> 00:11:52,559
there are local Enclosed Buildings

171
00:11:52,559 --> 00:11:54,120
of this kind, about 249 of them.

172
00:11:54,120 --> 00:11:56,279
Most are located deep in the mountains.

173
00:11:56,480 --> 00:11:58,879
The majority are abandoned and unmanaged,

174
00:11:59,000 --> 00:12:00,799
making arrests extremely difficult.

175
00:12:00,960 --> 00:12:01,759
That's right.

176
00:12:02,320 --> 00:12:03,279
Captain.

177
00:12:04,159 --> 00:12:05,080
Target number one,

178
00:12:05,080 --> 00:12:05,879
codename Grass Snake.

179
00:12:05,879 --> 00:12:06,799
Real name, Zhang Guangli.

180
00:12:07,279 --> 00:12:08,279
Target number two,

181
00:12:08,279 --> 00:12:09,200
codename Bro Liu.

182
00:12:09,200 --> 00:12:10,279
Real name, Liu Zhenqiang.

183
00:12:10,600 --> 00:12:13,399
The syndicate has about five departments.

184
00:12:13,399 --> 00:12:14,480
First, the Data Mining Department.

185
00:12:14,480 --> 00:12:15,639
It gathers information

186
00:12:15,759 --> 00:12:17,919
and filters out suitable targets to scam.

187
00:12:18,000 --> 00:12:19,559
The Fraud Call Department handles scams,

188
00:12:19,559 --> 00:12:20,879
making a huge volume of calls

189
00:12:20,879 --> 00:12:22,679
to find rare victims who will fall for it.

190
00:12:22,879 --> 00:12:24,440
Third, the Live Streaming Department.

191
00:12:24,440 --> 00:12:27,279
It uses porn and Suggestive live streaming

192
00:12:27,320 --> 00:12:28,919
to attract male victims.

193
00:12:28,919 --> 00:12:31,720
Card Farming Department provides cards.

194
00:12:31,720 --> 00:12:33,240
These bank and phone cards

195
00:12:33,240 --> 00:12:33,960
are all used to

196
00:12:33,960 --> 00:12:36,159
disperse the funds scammed from victims.

197
00:12:36,320 --> 00:12:37,559
Mules are responsible for withdrawing cash,

198
00:12:37,559 --> 00:12:40,759
making the victims' money untraceable.

199
00:12:41,159 --> 00:12:43,559
This is the entire syndicate structure.

200
00:12:43,679 --> 00:12:44,440
We also seized

201
00:12:44,440 --> 00:12:46,399
a large amount of past scam records.

202
00:12:46,399 --> 00:12:47,519
In these records, we also found...

203
00:12:49,919 --> 00:12:50,720
Found what?

204
00:12:51,360 --> 00:12:52,600
We found Sun Yao's records.

205
00:12:59,120 --> 00:12:59,919
Who are these two?

206
00:13:01,120 --> 00:13:03,679
This person is likely the ring's boss.

207
00:13:03,679 --> 00:13:05,000
His identity is currently a mystery.

208
00:13:05,080 --> 00:13:06,559
I refer to him as Y for short.

209
00:13:06,559 --> 00:13:09,480
Y's identity and profession are unknown.

210
00:13:09,559 --> 00:13:11,559
This person is likely his Spy.

211
00:13:11,759 --> 00:13:12,960
His identity is also a mystery right now.

212
00:13:13,200 --> 00:13:14,440
The recent intelligence leak

213
00:13:14,879 --> 00:13:16,559
is highly likely due to our operation

214
00:13:16,919 --> 00:13:19,200
being detected by this fraud ring's Spy.

215
00:13:19,279 --> 00:13:20,879
Highly likely, Captain.

216
00:13:21,600 --> 00:13:23,519
This Grass Snake connects everyone.

217
00:13:23,559 --> 00:13:25,480
Catch him, and we can uncover this Y.

218
00:13:25,759 --> 00:13:27,600
Rest assured, we are tracking him.

219
00:13:27,600 --> 00:13:28,440
Deploy more personnel.

220
00:13:28,600 --> 00:13:29,480
Get a headcount of the college students.

221
00:13:29,600 --> 00:13:31,840
We must promote anti-fraud in schools.

222
00:13:32,120 --> 00:13:33,679
We need to race against the criminals

223
00:13:33,679 --> 00:13:34,759
and race against time as well.

224
00:13:34,759 --> 00:13:35,720
We absolutely cannot allow

225
00:13:35,720 --> 00:13:37,080
another tragedy like Huang Shanshan's.

226
00:13:37,080 --> 00:13:38,000
Yes, sir.

227
00:13:38,279 --> 00:13:39,120
Get to work.

228
00:13:40,639 --> 00:13:41,440
Xiao Lin.

229
00:13:41,759 --> 00:13:43,039
Come with me to the hospital again

230
00:13:43,039 --> 00:13:44,000
to check on Huang Shanshan.

231
00:13:44,000 --> 00:13:45,120
Yes, Captain.

232
00:13:45,320 --> 00:13:46,440
By the way, Captain,

233
00:13:47,120 --> 00:13:49,080
we pooled this money together

234
00:13:49,080 --> 00:13:51,600
to cover her medical bills and tuition.

235
00:13:51,600 --> 00:13:52,679
It should be enough.

236
00:13:55,240 --> 00:13:56,480
You guys...

237
00:13:56,480 --> 00:13:57,679
...had the exact same idea I did.

238
00:13:58,759 --> 00:13:59,559
Hello?

239
00:14:00,559 --> 00:14:01,440
What?

240
00:14:01,679 --> 00:14:02,559
How could this happen?

241
00:14:03,320 --> 00:14:04,320
Huang Shanshan's condition has relapsed.

242
00:14:04,320 --> 00:14:04,879
She's in critical condition again.
